This repository includes materials derived from the Central Environment Council, Ministry of the Environment Japan (環境省 中央環境審議会), as well as original analyses and code authored by the contributors listed below.

Derived materials (such as plan texts and revision data) follow the Government of Japan Standard Terms of Use (Version 2.0), which is compatible with Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).

Original components—including classification, correspondence analysis, and all Python scripts—were created by:

- Akihiro Kameda (亀田 尭宙)
- Kohei Ishii（石井 康平）

